<p id="S3.SS3.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS3.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Joint Objective.</span>
We jointly optimize the outcome-based Agent RL and reflection OPD objectives:</p>
<table id="S3.E12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{ORPO}}=\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{RL}}+\lambda_{\mathrm{opd}}\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{OPD}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>ORPO</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>RL</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>opd</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mi>OPD</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{ORPO}}=\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{RL}}+\lambda_{\mathrm{opd}}\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{OPD}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS3.p4.2" class="ltx_p">The objective combines trajectory-level outcome learning with token-level reflection supervision,
further sharpening the proactive reflection of the policy.</p>
