</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p3.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SS3.p3.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p3.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Stateful research workflow: a query creates a session, iterative steps add notes and citations, and a final report is available only after the session reaches a reportable state. Session, step, and source records are separately addressable and may be paginated.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p3.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.SS3.p3.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p3.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#D6EAF8;">Representative tools</span></span>
