</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#D6EAF8;">Representative tools</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I7" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.2em;">
<span id="A5.I7.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I7.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I7.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I7.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">list_bases</span><span id="A5.I7.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: discover visible bases.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I7.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I7.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I7.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I7.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">list_tables</span><span id="A5.I7.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: enumerate tables within a selected base.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I7.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I7.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I7.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I7.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">list_fields</span><span id="A5.I7.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: verify the table schema.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I7.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I7.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I7.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I7.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">search_records</span><span id="A5.I7.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> / </span><span id="A5.I7.i4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">list_records</span><span id="A5.I7.i4.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: return filtered or paginated records.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I7.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I7.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I7.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I7.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">get_record</span><span id="A5.I7.i5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: read one record by its table-scoped identifier.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I7.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I7.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I7.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I7.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">update_record</span><span id="A5.I7.i6.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> / </span><span id="A5.I7.i6.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">delete_record</span><span id="A5.I7.i6.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: mutate records under schema and lifecycle constraints.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#FDEDEC;">Bad patterns</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I8" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.2em;">
<span id="A5.I8.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I8.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I8.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I8.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Act on a similar search hit without confirming the target base and table.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I8.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I8.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I8.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I8.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Omit the record identifier or post-write read, so the operation can affect the wrong scope and remain unverifiable.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#E8F6F3;">Extracted skills</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p4.pic1.p8" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I9" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.2em;">
<span id="A5.I9.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I9.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I9.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I9.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Resolve base, table, and record identifiers in that order and compare key fields with the user’s constraints.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I9.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I9.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I9.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I9.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Update only after an exact match, then re-read the record to verify committed values and lifecycle state.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="675.73" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 675.73" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,675.73) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#1B4F72;" fill="#1B4F72" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.98 L 0 670.75 C 0 673.5 2.23 675.73 4.98 675.73 L 472.4 675.73 C 475.15 675.73 477.38 673.5 477.38 670.75 L 477.38 4.98 C 477.38 2.23 475.15 0 472.4 0 L 4.98 0 C 2.23 0 0 2.23 0 4.98 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EAF3F8;" fill="#EAF3F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 4.98 L 0.83 651.43 L 476.55 651.43 L 476.55 4.98 C 476.55 2.69 474.69 0.83 472.4 0.83 L 4.98 0.83 C 2.69 0.83 0.83 2.69 0.83 4.98 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 15.84 659.43)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:24.4em;--ltx-fo-height:0.83em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.23em;font-size:10pt;" height="14.76" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 11.53)" width="337.63"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
