</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 15.84 90.21)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.82em;--ltx-fo-height:39.88em;--ltx-fo-depth:5.58em;font-size:10pt;" height="628.9" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 551.76)" width="481.81"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.82em;">
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#D6EAF8;">Environment</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Stateful hotel-search and booking workflow. A location query creates a search session, hotel results are paginated within that session, rate details are scoped to a returned hotel, and a booking attempt produces a lifecycle record and payment link.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#D6EAF8;">Representative tools</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I10" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.2em;">
<span id="A5.I10.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I10.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I10.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I10.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">find-place</span><span id="A5.I10.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: resolve free-text locations to coordinates.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I10.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I10.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I10.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I10.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">search-hotels</span><span id="A5.I10.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: start a session with dates, guests, and filters.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I10.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I10.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I10.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I10.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">load-more-hotels</span><span id="A5.I10.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: advance the session cursor.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I10.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I10.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I10.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I10.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">get-search-session</span><span id="A5.I10.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: verify query, pagination, and lifecycle state.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I10.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I10.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I10.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I10.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">get-hotel-details</span><span id="A5.I10.i5.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: expand a hotel returned by the session.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I10.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I10.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I10.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I10.i6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">book-hotel</span><span id="A5.I10.i6.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: initiate a booking for a currently valid rate.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#FDEDEC;">Bad patterns</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I11" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.2em;">
<span id="A5.I11.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I11.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I11.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I11.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Mix hotels or rates from different search sessions, or treat a paginated summary as complete.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I11.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I11.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I11.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I11.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Initiate booking without checking current availability and whether the rate belongs to the selected hotel.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#E8F6F3;">Extracted skills</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p5.pic1.p8" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I12" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.2em;">
<span id="A5.I12.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I12.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I12.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I12.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Preserve the session identifier and verify query parameters, pagination, hotel identity, and room/rate constraints at each step.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A5.I12.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A5.I12.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.I12.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I12.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Re-read the returned hotel/rate and booking records; treat payment-link creation as an initiated booking, not completed payment.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS3.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="660.11" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 660.11" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,660.11) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#1B4F72;" fill="#1B4F72" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 4.98 L 0 655.13 C 0 657.88 2.23 660.11 4.98 660.11 L 472.4 660.11 C 475.15 660.11 477.38 657.88 477.38 655.13 L 477.38 4.98 C 477.38 2.23 475.15 0 472.4 0 L 4.98 0 C 2.23 0 0 2.23 0 4.98 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#EAF3F8;" fill="#EAF3F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.83 4.98 L 0.83 639.05 L 476.55 639.05 L 476.55 4.98 C 476.55 2.69 474.69 0.83 472.4 0.83 L 4.98 0.83 C 2.69 0.83 0.83 2.69 0.83 4.98 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 15.84 643.82)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:24.4em;--ltx-fo-height:0.83em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="11.53" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 11.53)" width="337.63"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:24.4em;">
<span id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:120%;--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Semantic Scholar Server</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 15.84 90.21)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.82em;--ltx-fo-height:38.98em;--ltx-fo-depth:5.58em;font-size:10pt;" height="616.51" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 539.37)" width="481.81"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.82em;">
<span id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;--ltx-bg-color:#D6EAF8;">Environment</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Academic-literature environment for searching papers and authors and traversing citation/reference edges. Search is truncated, while detailed metadata and citation edges require stable paper or author identifiers and are cached for inspection.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.SS3.p6.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
